# Good-Guy-Economy path configuration — single source of truth for where the active
# investigation lives. Read by the TUI, the notifier, and the control server.
# The default is ~/.hermes/investigations/active. To change it, uncomment and write a FULL path
# (this file is read literally: no $HOME, no ~).
# GOOD_GUY_ECONOMY_INVESTIGATION_DIR=/home/you/.hermes/investigations/active
